<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Development Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Development Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the arrangers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GUANGDONG DEVELOPMENT BANK, ACTING THROUGH ITS MACAU</p>
<p>		BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$50 MLN   COUPON     3ML+45BP  MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCH    19.MAY.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	YR 2	REPLIES   04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	  SALE LMTS  STANDARD  TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  CHINA	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH   PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>  CO-ARRANGERS AND LEAD MANAGERS   US$5 MLN+    48BP  ALL-IN 61</p>
<p>  CO-LEAD MANAGERS		     US$3-4 MLN   45BP  ALL-IN 60</p>
<p>  MANAGERS				 US$2 MLN     42BP  ALL-IN 59</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   HSBC MARKETS, STANDARD CHARTERED BANK (BOOKS) AND</p>
<p>		 WESTLB HONG KONG (BOOKS)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
